WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Find your business. Enter a name. Review raw public matches and exact source links.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Review visibility evidence. Website signals have a defined rubric. Unknown data stays unknown.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Build your Business Graph. Confirm identity. Save history, contacts and relationships with proof.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Connect and unlock. Authorize accounts in CIA. Public links do not grant account access.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Create and review growth actions. Propose a plan from evidence. Approve tasks and record delivery proof.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Measure and rescore. Repeat the same measurement. Compare evidence before claiming growth.

